{"id":574,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"和と実を基盤に世界へ挑む人材育成","feature_description":"蒼開は、「社会に貢献できる人材の育成」を建学の精神とし、校訓「和と実」のもとで教育を行います。周囲と調和し、何事にも誠実に向き合い努力する姿勢を大切にし、淡路島から日本、世界へ羽ばたく力を養います。多様な人材の自己実現に向けたコースを設け、クラブ活動を通じて責任感と自主性も育成します。学習とスポーツの両面から、次の段階でも長く活躍できる人づくりを目指します。","clubs":[{"id":10846,"name":"男子サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10847,"name":"女子サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10848,"name":"女子硬式野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10849,"name":"柔道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10850,"name":"クライミング","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10851,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10852,"name":"水泳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10853,"name":"硬式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10854,"name":"ボート","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10855,"name":"アスレティック","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10856,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10857,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10858,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.soukai-school.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10859,"name":"ジャズバンド","catego